Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's go to heaven together.{\i0}{EP40}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thus begins our trip to hell.{\i0}{EP40}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.27,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What should I do?!{EP40}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.22,0:00:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no longer capisce!{it was capisce}{EP40}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.03,0:01:49.62,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You want Lala to join Alomagedon-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.47,0:01:51.80,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:53.20,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Come Lala,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:56.87,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,partake in this{take a bite of this} forbidden apple and become our partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.87,0:02:00.04,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,With this you should quietly obey us.{It is said that it will make you quietly obey.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.38,0:02:02.00,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,L-Like I said, I{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:04.22,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,She's not interested-pri!{refusal}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.58,0:02:05.42,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.42,0:02:05.93,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Nano?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:09.66,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Lala is a vital member of SoLaMi Smile-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.66,0:02:11.68,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I won't let you take her-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.15,0:02:16.90,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,It would seem thee do not understand the horror which befalls those who defy us demons.{It seems thee does not understand what horror will befall thee for defying a demon.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.90,0:02:20.96,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,It's more like being a demon doesn't suit an idol-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.96,0:02:21.65,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:24.75,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Idols are meant to bring everyone happiness,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.75,0:02:27.24,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,so acting like a demon is a complete failure-pri.{which would make a demon a complete failure of one-pri.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.24,0:02:30.37,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You better rethink your character image-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.37,0:02:34.67,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Your pri this and pri that character trait is completely shallow!{Your character image with all pri this and pri that is the most shallow of all!}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.67,0:02:35.66,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.66,0:02:42.22,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,A strange demon such as yourself would never understand the depth of my pop character.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.22,0:02:44.09,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mirelle's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.09,0:02:46.88,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I have no intention of leaving SoLaMi Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:49.82,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:52.60,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I won't join Spring Roll Bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.57,0:02:56.98,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,It's not Spring Roll Bowl!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:02:58.06,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,It's Alomagedon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.06,0:02:59.01,Default-Alt,Aloma,0,0,0,,Alomage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:02:59.50,Default-Alt,Aloma,0,0,0,,Alomage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.50,0:03:01.69,Default-Alt,Aloma,0,0,0,,A-lo-ma-ge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.75,0:03:00.27,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mirelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.27,0:03:03.06,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I was just stating the obvious-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.06,0:03:05.48,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,The three of us will always be together.{The three of us will stay together no matter what happens.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.94,0:03:08.45,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,A spring roll bowl sounds delicious-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.45,0:03:11.67,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm not good at dealing with these kinds of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:15.29,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}I must hastily cast those who defy my prophecy into the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.74,0:03:16.75,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.23,0:03:18.72,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Hear this, Mirelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:19.21,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pr{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.21,0:03:23.38,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Under the next full moon, your soul shall be sold to the devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:25.42,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,and SoLaMi Smile shall be no more{disbanded}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:28.53,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.17,0:03:33.06,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,The final results of the genuine vote are in.{strictness, as in no cheating}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:36.31,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Paprika Academy's next student council president is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.79,0:03:41.56,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,...Minami Mirelle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.56,0:03:42.48,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,You may cheer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.46,0:03:44.69,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:46.97,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.97,0:03:53.16,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,I'll be able to watch over her as the assistant treasurer's understudy once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:56.99,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.99,0:03:59.06,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Tell mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.51,0:04:01.60,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.60,0:04:05.78,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,You want to see Minami-san's student council president inauguration PriPara concert?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:08.54,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Wow! What a nice idea, Rina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:12.84,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,And to top it off, she'll be performing a special solo concert.{With that, it's been decided she will perform a special solo concert.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.97,0:04:18.38,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Now then, a few words from Minami-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:23.59,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Thank you all so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.59,0:04:26.99,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,So that I don't soil the position of student council president,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.99,0:04:30.57,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I will put extra effort into my studies, and of course, PriPara!{work harder at my studies and, of course, PriPara!}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:32.82,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah! Hooray! Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:38.83,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Complete-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.17,0:04:41.79,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:44.71,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Look, it's the two from Alomagedon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:48.22,Default-Alt,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devidevi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.12,0:04:48.22,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,That was a wonderful and mysterious début concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:50.17,Default-Alt,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mika! Mika! Mikan!{みかみかみっか～ん｡}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:50.17,Default,Rand3,0,0,0,,I'm a believer.{im sticking with believer instead of fan here cause of their whole angel/demon thing}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:52.62,Default-Alt,Rand4,0,0,0,,They even invited Lala-chan to join their team.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:54.73,Default-Alt,Rand4,0,0,0,,I wonder what'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:55.90,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:04:58.36,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,They're quite popular-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:04:59.39,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.39,0:05:03.52,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Under the next full moon, your soul shall be sold to the devil,{consistency}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.52,0:05:05.60,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,and SoLaMi Smile shall be no more{disbanded}.{consistency}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:08.33,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,She said something really weird back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:10.36,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,But it's probably not worth worrying about-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.36,0:05:11.99,Default,Lafie,0,0,0,,Mirelle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.23,0:05:15.03,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Congrats on your solo concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:16.66,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Thanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.66,0:05:20.25,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,but you can do a solo concert whenever you want-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:22.08,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,This one is special.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.93,0:05:23.83,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.83,0:05:25.05,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:25.92,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:27.65,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I got you a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.65,0:05:28.04,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.34,0:05:32.69,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Remeber how I had that hair accessory in my last concert?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.69,0:05:37.03,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Well, I asked Mega-neesan to make a few with different colours.{technically says "specially make a few with different colors"}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.03,0:05:38.29,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.29,0:05:38.96,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:41.08,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll be happy when she receives it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:44.86,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I got one for you too, Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.86,0:05:46.18,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,For me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:47.06,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.06,0:05:49.36,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,If the three of us have a matching set,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:51.82,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll be able to reform soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:53.38,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.01,0:05:55.36,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,How embarrassing-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:55.78,Default,Laphie,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:59.44,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Having you give me such a wonderful present,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:01.74,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I'm so happy it's embarrassing-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.23,0:06:03.25,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mirelle...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.71,0:06:05.47,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Thank you-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.47,0:06:08.71,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,This signals the start of SoLaMi Smile's reformation!{This is a sign of SoLaMi Smile's reformation}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:13.76,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,With this, tomorrow's concert will be absolutely perfect-pri!{i'll perform a perfect concert tomorrow by using this}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:15.72,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Great! I'll be cheering for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:18.39,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Derodero!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.90,0:06:21.10,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:23.31,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Here you are-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:27.27,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,With the three of them willing to go that far to reform,{want to reform that badly}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.27,0:06:31.36,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,maybe I should man up and face this curse head on-kuma.{maybe I should help them and not be afraid of this curse-kuma.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.36,0:06:32.48,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Neko!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.82,0:06:35.95,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,H-How mean-nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.95,0:06:36.90,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:40.03,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,So you really don't believe me-nekon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.03,0:06:43.29,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I even gave you that warning because I was worried about you, Kuma-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.29,0:06:45.21,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,You're an idiot, moron, imbecile, Kuma-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.21,0:06:47.82,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I don't know you any more-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.82,0:06:51.17,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Cheer up, Neko-neesan-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.17,0:06:53.13,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Look at me-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.13,0:06:55.55,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Here! Come play!{>_>  liberal}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.55,0:06:57.28,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Here-ereere...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.28,0:07:00.39,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Oh, just this once...{just for a little while}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:02.45,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,How irresistible!{same meaning as たまらない}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.45,0:07:04.64,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I won't hesitate any more-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:07.60,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I truly enjoy being afraid to death by this curse!{I'll continue to be deathly afraid of the curse...\NI like it!}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:10.81,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'll leave that lump of cotton to Neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:15.10,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Derodero derosaimu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.10,0:07:17.76,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Derodero derosaimu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.76,0:07:20.45,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Awaken, my mischievous{alt evil} servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.83,0:07:26.48,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.36,0:07:31.78,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3, 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:34.07,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3, 4-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.42,0:07:41.64,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I'll make tomorrow's concert a hit no matter what-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:42.64,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,And on top of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.01,0:07:46.45,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Lala's present makes me so happy-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.49,0:07:56.70,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What's this?! What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:01.84,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,That was frightening-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:04.00,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I wonder what that was-pri.{keeping up her pri even when alone!  At'ta girl!}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:09.29,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,She's yet to understand how terrible my curse is.{the ka is the particle for the unsaid 分からない because there's a question word in the phrase}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.77,0:08:13.54,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, Mirelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.54,0:08:16.50,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,That's enough practice-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.45,0:08:19.60,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,With this, tomorrow will be perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.01,0:08:22.47,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.30,0:08:25.57,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Lala's present...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.57,0:08:26.36,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:27.18,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:31.60,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,How'd it... get up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:38.03,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I can't reach!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.43,0:08:39.24,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:39.99,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,It's not there-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:41.95,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri? Pri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.30,0:08:43.44,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.44,0:08:45.59,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Where is it-pri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:48.20,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.20,0:08:50.66,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Why's it in the hallway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:52.37,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:54.00,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,It's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:55.54,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:56.34,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:08:58.05,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri?! Pri?! Pri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:08:59.76,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.23,0:09:01.47,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.24,0:09:03.93,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.93,0:09:05.49,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.49,0:09:07.39,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,The present is running away-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:10.31,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,It's not here! Or here! Or here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.31,0:09:12.81,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Or here! Or here! Or here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:16.17,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Where did it run off to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.18,0:09:19.69,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:22.69,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I've completely lost track of it-pri.{not in her eyesight}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:27.37,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mirelle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.73,0:09:28.83,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Lala...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.83,0:09:31.61,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What time is your concert tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.61,0:09:34.08,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,W-Well, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.59,0:09:39.38,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should be honest and tell her I lost her present-pri!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.38,0:09:41.30,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Lie to her.{Devieve her and lie.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.30,0:09:44.32,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Sell thine soul to the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:46.01,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I-I wouldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.39,0:09:48.09,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Don't do it-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.09,0:09:50.57,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,You should tell her the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.57,0:09:51.47,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.47,0:09:53.00,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Lie to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:54.24,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,The truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.24,0:09:55.17,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.17,0:09:55.94,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.43,0:09:58.22,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The present ran away?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:10:00.09,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Who would believe such a thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.43,0:09:57.46,Default-Alt,Lala,0,0,0,,{bg} Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:10:00.09,Default-Alt,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{bg} Hold on-pri. Pri pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.09,0:10:02.41,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,If thee tell her the truth, thine life will become hell.{ it will be hell.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:05.70,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,By hurting Lala's feelings, she'll end up leaving thee,{Lala's feelings will be hurt, and she will end her friendship with you,}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:08.12,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,thus signaling the end of SoLaMi Smile.{lit and leave SoLaMi Smile - but going over dramatic here}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.87,0:10:11.08,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose her-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.47,0:10:13.58,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Lying is bad-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.58,0:10:16.85,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Lying is the worst thing to do in a relationship-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.66,0:10:16.85,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{can't make out enough of the BG to put something here}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:19.14,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,If you do that, Lala-chan will be shocked, get angry,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.14,0:10:22.52,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,and never want to see you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.01,0:10:24.72,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:26.74,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Lie to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.74,0:10:28.02,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:28.97,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Tell her the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.97,0:10:32.22,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Yes, truth! Gel gel! Truth! Truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.97,0:10:32.22,Default-Alt,Mikan,0,0,0,,Lie! Lie! Devi devi! Lie! Lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.51,0:10:34.60,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,The angel or demon...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:37.94,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,The outcome will be horrible no matter who I side with-pri!{It'll be the worst possible outcome no matter who I listen to-pri!!}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.31,0:10:39.90,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What's going on, Mirelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.42,0:10:43.79,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,N-Nothing-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:45.20,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:48.32,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm glad my present has made you so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.77,0:10:53.79,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Lala, about that, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:55.15,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Beep! *fuzzzz*
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.15,0:10:56.50,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,S-Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.50,0:10:57.62,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I'm losing....
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.62,0:10:58.85,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,*fuzzzzzz* Beep!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:10:59.79,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,...signal! Beep!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:01.96,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,*fuzzzzzzz*
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.86,0:11:07.63,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Attention idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.63,0:11:12.98,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,This is to inform you that we'll be starting our periodic checks of hologramation and that the sky will be switched to night.{We'll be starting periodic checks of hologramation and are informing you that we'll be turning the sky into night.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.98,0:11:14.60,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,This was a system message!{This was the system!}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.29,0:11:21.17,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Under the next full moon...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.17,0:11:23.27,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,...SoLaMi Smile shall be no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.86,0:11:28.52,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:29.87,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:35.47,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The more beautiful the friendship, the more beautiful it is to crush it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.47,0:11:39.00,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,The more delicious the meat bun, the more delicious it is to eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:41.96,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Mirelle is a single step away from destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:43.41,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,And thus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.41,0:11:44.17,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Yum! Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.49,0:11:46.66,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Lala, Shion, Dorthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:52.14,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,I shall tempt those three into forming the Dream Team Dream Alomagedon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:56.60,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Yummy yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:10.57,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to find Lala's present.{ in the end.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.91,0:12:13.29,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,And I even said that it signaled the beginning of our reformation.{consistency}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.86,0:12:15.70,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mirelle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.70,0:12:17.36,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Isn't it about time for your solo concert?{It's about time for your solo concert, huh?!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:18.93,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.93,0:12:21.25,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You should change into your coord soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.57,0:12:24.18,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I probably should...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.18,0:12:27.25,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,But to tell you the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.49,0:12:30.72,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I'm going to be wearing a different coord-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.09,0:12:32.01,Default,Laphie,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.01,0:12:33.83,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,According to various calculations,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.83,0:12:37.62,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I've found that this coord is the best match for today's concert-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.62,0:12:41.49,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Because of that, I won't be able to wear the hair accessory you gave me-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.15,0:12:44.11,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,It's unfortunate-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.11,0:12:45.59,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.71,0:12:47.96,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.96,0:12:50.49,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Seeing as you calculated it, it must be right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.49,0:12:52.70,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,O-Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:58.12,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to "A pop and a step and I've gotcha!" as ever!{naisho steal, dono if I like, tho}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.12,0:13:00.04,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,All right, it's about time for my concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:12.16,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I didn't have a choice-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.16,0:13:13.93,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I had to-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.71,0:13:15.98,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:17.03,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.03,0:13:19.14,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,The hand you used with "gotcha" earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.14,0:13:20.35,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.75,0:13:24.11,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,...was off by one jellyfish leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.49,0:13:29.01,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.01,0:13:31.53,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,H-How could you tell-pri?{H-How do you know-pri?}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.93,0:13:33.99,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I just could.{I know you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.03,0:13:38.17,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Sophie...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.97,0:13:39.87,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.79,0:13:43.09,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It's time for your concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.09,0:13:44.41,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.47,0:13:53.09,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,H-Hello everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.09,0:13:59.81,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming to Mirelle's Paprika Academy Student Council President Inaugural special concert today!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.45,0:14:03.52,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I hope we have a lot of fun together-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.89,0:14:09.23,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Together...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.74,0:14:12.40,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seeing as you calculated it, it must be right!{consistency}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.07,0:14:14.36,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,{\i1}I just could.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.05,0:14:20.03,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mirelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.36,0:14:24.00,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.42,0:14:29.71,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,To be honest, I lost the present a very important friend of mine gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.99,0:14:30.73,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:36.38,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I can't sing like this.{with these feelings}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.01,0:14:37.63,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.29,0:14:39.09,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mirelle...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.55,0:14:41.42,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,So today's concert will{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:42.06,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.48,0:14:52.69,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.69,0:14:55.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sophie, I have something I need to take care of!{ I'll be back in a little bit.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.45,0:14:58.95,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Just what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.95,0:15:00.73,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm sure everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:03.16,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Until then, pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:03.16,Default-Alt,Leona,0,0,0,,Sophie-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:04.51,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.51,0:15:07.09,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,but we have to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.09,0:15:07.87,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's do it.{there's no helping it}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.86,0:15:14.88,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Please stick around, everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.88,0:15:16.97,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Mirelle will be back shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.97,0:15:19.18,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Until then, we'll entertain you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.77,0:15:20.69,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Let's go!{Us too!}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.69,0:15:21.50,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:25.14,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Tension max!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.14,0:15:27.02,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.02,0:15:28.60,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:35.24,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,How'd it get over here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:37.00,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,This time...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.00,0:15:37.78,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.78,0:15:40.20,Default,Panda,0,0,0,,Haven't you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.20,0:15:43.37,Default,Panda,0,0,0,,The Dream Theatre is still under construction-panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.37,0:15:45.20,Default,Panda,0,0,0,,Out'ta the way! Out'ta the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.26,0:15:45.20,Default-Alt,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.66,0:15:49.37,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I-It's over-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.03,0:15:57.05,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.05,0:15:58.26,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Deko?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.65,0:16:02.47,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What the-pri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.45,0:16:06.12,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Mine servant has revealed it's true form.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:07.94,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,A frog-nano?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.94,0:16:09.66,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,You summoned that-nano?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:10.44,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:13.40,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,However, there's something I still don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.40,0:16:14.92,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.92,0:16:16.42,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.42,0:16:18.03,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Lala's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.36,0:16:21.34,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mirelle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.34,0:16:22.46,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Lala...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.89,0:16:25.01,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.01,0:16:28.74,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I forgot to actually put the ribbon in the box!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.74,0:16:30.15,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\t(0,1000,\fscx130\fscy130)}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.88,0:16:34.96,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I was in a rush to give it to you,{I was sure I put it in the box that night,}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.96,0:16:37.25,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,and didn't make sure that I actually put it in the box the previous night.{less lib: since I was sure I put it in the box the previous night.}{and then in a rush I gave it to you that morning.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.66,0:16:40.61,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,T-That's what happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.61,0:16:42.26,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.78,0:16:48.45,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,No, if I had not lied and just told you the truth, we would have figured it out sooner-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:55.01,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,But I was afraid you'd get upset and leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.01,0:16:56.23,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.77,0:16:58.44,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'd never leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.36,0:17:04.61,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Regardless of what happens, both Sophie and I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.61,0:17:05.70,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Lala...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:07.91,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lala.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.58,0:17:09.38,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:12.37,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've been thanked for accidentally screwing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.09,0:17:17.29,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,So that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.29,0:17:19.78,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I thought I'd play a trick on her,{take part in a little mischief,}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.78,0:17:22.09,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,but when I opened the box,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.09,0:17:24.82,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,it was empty for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.82,0:17:27.45,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I continued with the plan and put a frog inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.45,0:17:29.26,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,but something still felt off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.25,0:17:31.68,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Tricks are bad-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.68,0:17:33.16,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.16,0:17:34.88,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,But it's a demon's job to trick people.{Tricks are a demon's work.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.88,0:17:37.77,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Then it's an angel's job to put an end to those tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.77,0:17:39.43,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Here's a meat and potato bun. Eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:42.74,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.74,0:17:48.16,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.06,0:17:51.97,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:57.54,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,By making bold use of the vivid colours,\Neven a cute design can be transformed into pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.87,0:18:00.96,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,And the colour of the hair pin Lala-san chose is a perfect match!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.96,0:18:03.22,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Dream Heart Race Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.22,0:18:04.05,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.47,0:18:08.24,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Somehow we lasted long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.24,0:18:09.74,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,We'll leave the rest to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.74,0:18:11.43,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.77,0:18:15.08,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.08,0:18:17.27,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I found my present!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.27,0:18:20.61,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,The power of friendship will make this a special concert-pri!{Thanks to the power of friendship, this'll be a special concert-pri!}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.61,0:18:22.15,Default,All,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.63,0:18:51.01,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,660)}Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:33.51,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.51,0:19:36.64,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,660)}Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.73,0:19:51.41,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Fresh Sweets Park!{naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.78,0:19:55.58,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:02.54,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.82,0:20:43.41,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Way to go, Mirelle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:44.91,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.91,0:20:46.96,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Brilliantly done, Student Council President!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.02,0:20:52.49,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Thank you-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:20:58.39,Default-Alt,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Mirelle-chan has blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.39,0:20:59.10,Default-Alt,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.31,0:21:03.39,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That was great, Mirelle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.39,0:21:04.27,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.27,0:21:07.02,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you two-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.02,0:21:07.80,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.80,0:21:10.65,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's work even harder towards our reformation-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.65,0:21:11.24,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.24,0:21:12.24,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.24,0:21:13.41,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.41,0:21:15.20,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,It seems we failed-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.18,0:21:18.45,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Next time will be a pizza bun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.45,0:21:20.41,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I guess I'll have to get serious.{They've forced me to get serious.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.78,0:21:24.87,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The next prophecy; chapter 4, section 44:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.87,0:21:30.47,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,"The dark arrow let loose by a demon shall pursue the red haired maiden."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.61,0:23:08.32,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,La la lala~.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.32,0:23:10.56,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You're sure in high spirits, Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.56,0:23:14.58,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,My beloved father will be returning from abroad soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.58,0:23:16.82,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh? What's your father like?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.82,0:23:22.68,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,He's like a {Nomura's }jellyfish, a whale shark, and a footballfish all in one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.16,0:23:24.61,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I don't know how to imagine that.{I don't know what that means.}{Can we just put "What the fuck you talking about willis?"?}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.61,0:23:27.74,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It seems he has something important to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:28.49,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.49,0:23:30.00,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,The Man From Brazil.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.00,0:23:31.97,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Wild!{A stupid cultural reference from a few years ago.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.97,0:23:33.37,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.37,0:23:34.96,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
